</div>
</div>
<div class="clear"></div>
</div>
<div class="clear"></div>
</div>
<div class="clear"></div>
</div>
<div class="clear"></div>
</div>
<div class="clear"></div>
<div class="home-projectWrap">
<div class="container_16">
<div class="grid_16">
<div class="home-projectInner">
<div class="home-projectLeft">
<div class="home-projectBox" id="vision">
<div class="home-projectImg animated anim_left">
<h3>Vision</h3>
<img class="jch-lazyload" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4MDAiIGhlaWdodD0iODIxIj48L3N2Zz4=" data-src="/images/about/vision.webp" width="800" height="821" /><noscript><img src="/images/about/vision.webp" width="800" height="821" /></noscript> </div>
<div class="home-projectInfo animated anim_right">
<h3>Vision</h3>
<p>To show the way for Pune to evolve to the next is not just our vision, it’s our responsibility. At Ravetkar Group, we believe true evolution blends the wisdom of the past with the promise of the future. Rooted in Pune’s rich cultural and architectural legacy, our work strives to enhance the city’s liveability through thoughtfully crafted spaces. Our vision is to shape homes and landmarks that reflect the aspirations of modern Pune while staying emotionally and aesthetically connected to its heritage. </p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="home-projectBox">
<div class="home-projectImg animated anim_left">
<h3>Mission</h3>
<img class="jch-lazyload" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4MDAiIGhlaWdodD0iODIxIj48L3N2Zz4=" data-src="/images/about/mission.webp" width="800" height="821" /><noscript><img src="/images/about/mission.webp" width="800" height="821" /></noscript> </div>
<div class="home-projectInfo animated anim_right">
<h3>Mission</h3>
<ul>
<li>To create homes and spaces that evolve with Pune’s unique cultural and urban character</li>
<li>To maintain the highest standards in quality, design, and delivery through every phase of construction</li>
<li>To uphold transparency and trust across all relationships with customers, partners, and communities</li>
<li>To lead the city’s redevelopment journey with sensitivity, respect, and innovation</li>
<li>To empower our team and collaborators to think boldly and work with integrity</li>
<li>To delight Punekars by offering lifestyle upgrades rooted in familiarity, comfort, and aspiration</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div class="home-projectBox marginbottom0" id="values">
<div class="home-projectImg animated anim_left">
<h3>Core Values</h3>
<img class="jch-lazyload" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4MDAiIGhlaWdodD0iODIxIj48L3N2Zz4=" data-src="/images/about/corevaluews.webp" width="800" height="821" /><noscript><img src="/images/about/corevaluews.webp" width="800" height="821" /></noscript> </div>
<div class="home-projectInfo animated anim_right">
<h3>Core Values</h3>
<p>These are not just principles on paper. They are lived, shared, and reflected in every square foot we deliver, since inception!</p>
<p><strong>Integrity:</strong> We build with honesty, follow through on promises, and stand by our word</p>
<p><strong>Empathy:</strong> We understand the emotional connection people share with their homes and communities and we honour it in our work</p>
<p><strong>Progress:</strong> We embrace evolution by continually improving our designs, practices, and experiences</p>
<p>These values shape the way we interact, create, and contribute to the changing yet rooted landscape of Pune.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="home-projectRight animated anim_fadein delay02">
<h2>Legacy in Every Landmark</h2>
<p>Take a look at our brand ethos, values, and milestones. Ravetkar is a name that is synonymous with Pune's evolved way of living and we are proud to maintain this identity for the last 3 decades.</p>
<div class="corporatefilmWrap">
<iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/VTqcuCcISOY?si=Y2SQHMu759T0qJ0j" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
</div>
</div>
