</div>
<div class="clear"></div>
<div class="teamWrap" id="ourteam">
<div class="container_16">
<div class="grid_16">
<div class="teamInner">
<h2 class="animated anim_fadein">Leadership Team</h2>
<div class="teamGroup">
<div class="teamLeft animated anim_left"> <img class="jch-lazyload" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI2MDEiIGhlaWdodD0iNDg3Ij48L3N2Zz4=" data-src="/images/about/amol-ravetkar.webp" width="601" height="487" /><noscript><img src="/images/about/amol-ravetkar.webp" width="601" height="487" /></noscript> </div>
<div class="teamRight animated anim_right">
<h3>Amol Ravetkar</h3>
<div class="designation">CMD, Ravetkar Group</div>
<p>A second-generation entrepreneur and leader, he has taken the ambition and presence of Ravetkar Group to newer horizons and heights. With professionalism for doing things perfectly and passion to raise the bar, Mr. Amol Ravetkar leads a team of 30 skilled professionals. Under his guidance, Ravetkar Group has made a name for itself in the field of redevelopment.</p>
<h4>"To me, Pune has always been a city of comfort!"</h4>
<p>However, as the focus shifted from education to industrialisation, the gap between traditional and modern Pune started becoming more and more visible. So, as an entrepreneur, it has always been my dream to give this city a fresh identity. One that blends old values with new trends, helping Pune and Punekars evolve with time.</p>
<p>By putting quality engineering at the centre, our vision is to offer an upgraded lifestyle. With functional design features, need-based amenities and rich specifications, we create thoughtful spaces at prime locations in Pune that ensure upgrade for all!</p>
<p>- Amol Ravetkar</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="clear"></div>
</div>
<div class="clear"></div>
</div>
<div class="clear"></div>
</div>
<div class="clear"></div>
</div>
<div class="clear"></div>
<div class="galleryWrap">
<div class="container_16">
<div class="grid_16">
<div class="galleryInner">
<div class="galleryAwards">
