<div class="container_16">
<div class="grid_16">
<div class="humansofravetkarInner">
<h2 class="animated anim_fadein">Humans of Ravetkar</h2>
<div class="humansofravetkarSlider slider">
<div><a class="popup-youtube"  href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hzkLes9DSzM" target="_blank">
<div class="humansvideoBox">
<div class="humansvideo"> <img class="jch-lazyload" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI2MzAiIGhlaWdodD0iMzUzIj48L3N2Zz4=" data-src="/images/humansofravetkar/amit-jinralkar.png" width="630" height="353" /><noscript><img src="/images/humansofravetkar/amit-jinralkar.png" width="630" height="353" /></noscript> <img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEiPjwvc3ZnPg==" data-src="/images/youtube-icon.svg" class="videoIcon animated anim_fadein jch-lazyload"><noscript><img src="/images/youtube-icon.svg" class="videoIcon animated anim_fadein"></noscript> </div>
<div class="humansvideoInfo">
<h3>Mr Amit Jinralkar, Humans Of Ravetkar</h3>
<p>People often ask me what truly builds an organisation. For me, the answer has always been people who grow with you.Amit Jinralkar comes with 25 years of experience, 20 of them in sales. But over the last 2 years at Ravetkar Group, what I’ve seen most is his openness to learn, adapt, and lead with integrity.</p>
</div>
</div>
</a> </div>
<div><a class="popup-youtube"  href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NdkqAkFFQok" target="_blank">
<div class="humansvideoBox">
<div class="humansvideo"> <img class="jch-lazyload" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI2MzAiIGhlaWdodD0iMzUzIj48L3N2Zz4=" data-src="/images/humansofravetkar/rupa-dantale.webp" width="630" height="353" /><noscript><img src="/images/humansofravetkar/rupa-dantale.webp" width="630" height="353" /></noscript> <img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEiPjwvc3ZnPg==" data-src="/images/youtube-icon.svg" class="videoIcon animated anim_fadein jch-lazyload"><noscript><img src="/images/youtube-icon.svg" class="videoIcon animated anim_fadein"></noscript> </div>
<div class="humansvideoInfo">
<h3>Mrs. Rupa Dantale, Humans Of Ravetkar</h3>
<p>In 2017, Rupa Dantale stepped into the Ravetkar Group, bringing a wealth of real estate experience and her signature drive. As our Vice President leading sales, marketing, redevelopment, she’s been the catalyst behind some of our biggest transformations-always approaching every challenge with strategy, empathy, vision.</p>
</div>
</div>
</a> </div>
<div><a class="popup-youtube"  href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7S7k2ziv0CY" target="_blank">
<div class="humansvideoBox">
<div class="humansvideo"> <img class="jch-lazyload" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI2MzAiIGhlaWdodD0iMzUzIj48L3N2Zz4=" data-src="/images/humansofravetkar/ajit-shelar.webp" width="630" height="353" /><noscript><img src="/images/humansofravetkar/ajit-shelar.webp" width="630" height="353" /></noscript> <img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEiPjwvc3ZnPg==" data-src="/images/youtube-icon.svg" class="videoIcon animated anim_fadein jch-lazyload"><noscript><img src="/images/youtube-icon.svg" class="videoIcon animated anim_fadein"></noscript> </div>
<div class="humansvideoInfo">
<h3>Ajit Shelar, Humans of Ravetkar</h3>
<p>Meet Ajit Shelar, one of our most cherished team members, who has been with Ravetkar since our earliest projects. From building foundations to mentoring many, his journey reflects our true strength — our people. This is the first story in Humans of Ravetkar, a series celebrating those who are the heart of our company.</p>
</div>
</div>
</a> </div>
<div><a class="popup-youtube"  href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CjfMiqpN6YM" target="_blank">
<div class="humansvideoBox">
<div class="humansvideo"> <img class="jch-lazyload" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI2MzAiIGhlaWdodD0iMzUzIj48L3N2Zz4=" data-src="/images/humansofravetkar/shankar-nagtilak.webp" width="630" height="353" /><noscript><img src="/images/humansofravetkar/shankar-nagtilak.webp" width="630" height="353" /></noscript> <img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEiPjwvc3ZnPg==" data-src="/images/youtube-icon.svg" class="videoIcon animated anim_fadein jch-lazyload"><noscript><img src="/images/youtube-icon.svg" class="videoIcon animated anim_fadein"></noscript> </div>
<div class="humansvideoInfo">
<h3>Shankar Nagtilak, Humans of Ravetkar</h3>
<p>Mr. Shankar Nagtilak, our very first employee, has been with Ravetkar since day one — through uncertainty, milestones, and growth. More than a colleague, he’s family. In this Humans of Ravetkar story, he shares his leap of faith and the relationships that shaped who we are today.</p>
</div>
</div>
</a> </div>
<div><a class="popup-youtube"  href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-DlXGhYRLMY" target="_blank">
<div class="humansvideoBox">
<div class="humansvideo"> <img class="jch-lazyload" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI2MzAiIGhlaWdodD0iMzUzIj48L3N2Zz4=" data-src="/images/humansofravetkar/devraj-wadekar.webp" width="630" height="353" /><noscript><img src="/images/humansofravetkar/devraj-wadekar.webp" width="630" height="353" /></noscript><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEiPjwvc3ZnPg==" data-src="/images/youtube-icon.svg" class="videoIcon animated anim_fadein jch-lazyload"><noscript><img src="/images/youtube-icon.svg" class="videoIcon animated anim_fadein"></noscript> </div>
<div class="humansvideoInfo">
<h3>Devraj Wadekar, Humans of Ravetkar</h3>
<p>For 15 years, Mr. Devraj Wadekar has been a steady force at Ravetkar, leading projects with precision and building trust across teams. His loyalty, dedication, and calm leadership have been invaluable to our growth. Thank you, Devraj, for your unwavering commitment to our vision.</p>
</div>
</div>
</a> </div>
<div><a class="popup-youtube"  href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fZNrVT-p6GQ" target="_blank">
<div class="humansvideoBox">
<div class="humansvideo"> <img class="jch-lazyload" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI2MzAiIGhlaWdodD0iMzUzIj48L3N2Zz4=" data-src="/images/humansofravetkar/sayali-shelar.webp" width="630" height="353" /><noscript><img src="/images/humansofravetkar/sayali-shelar.webp" width="630" height="353" /></noscript><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEiPjwvc3ZnPg==" data-src="/images/youtube-icon.svg" class="videoIcon animated anim_fadein jch-lazyload"><noscript><img src="/images/youtube-icon.svg" class="videoIcon animated anim_fadein"></noscript> </div>
<div class="humansvideoInfo">
<h3>Sayali Shelar, Humans Of Ravetkar</h3>
<p>For eight years, Sayali Shelar, our Purchase Head, has been the backbone of vendor management at Ravetkar—balancing cost, quality, and timely delivery with quiet resilience. Her precision, patience, and commitment make her an integral part of our legacy.</p>
</div>
</div>
</a> </div>
<div><a class="popup-youtube"  href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=szFxmu_ChCw" target="_blank">
<div class="humansvideoBox">
<div class="humansvideo"> <img class="jch-lazyload" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI2MzAiIGhlaWdodD0iMzUzIj48L3N2Zz4=" data-src="/images/humansofravetkar/manasi-biradar.webp" width="630" height="353" /><noscript><img src="/images/humansofravetkar/manasi-biradar.webp" width="630" height="353" /></noscript> <img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEiPjwvc3ZnPg==" data-src="/images/youtube-icon.svg" class="videoIcon animated anim_fadein jch-lazyload"><noscript><img src="/images/youtube-icon.svg" class="videoIcon animated anim_fadein"></noscript> </div>
<div class="humansvideoInfo">
<h3>Manasi Biradar, Humans of Ravetkar</h3>
<p>In five years, Manasi Biradar has grown from Admin Executive to leading our Admin department—quietly ensuring smooth operations and flawless client experiences. With calm determination and unwavering reliability, she’s become an anchor of Ravetkar.</p>
</div>
</div>
</a> </div>
<div><a class="popup-youtube"  href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DzWj1hHlvTQ" target="_blank">
<div class="humansvideoBox">
<div class="humansvideo"> <img class="jch-lazyload" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI2MzAiIGhlaWdodD0iMzUzIj48L3N2Zz4=" data-src="/images/humansofravetkar/ankit-limaye.webp" width="630" height="353" /><noscript><img src="/images/humansofravetkar/ankit-limaye.webp" width="630" height="353" /></noscript> <img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEiPjwvc3ZnPg==" data-src="/images/youtube-icon.svg" class="videoIcon animated anim_fadein jch-lazyload"><noscript><img src="/images/youtube-icon.svg" class="videoIcon animated anim_fadein"></noscript> </div>
<div class="humansvideoInfo">
<h3>Ankit Limaye, Humans of Ravetkar</h3>
<p>For seven years, Ankit Limaye has led Sales & CRM at Ravetkar with a focus on trust and lasting relationships. More than selling homes, he creates experiences that reflect our values. Grateful for his commitment and many milestones ahead.</p>
</div>
</div>
</a> </div>
